### 访问计数器（每请求一次 visits +1）
GET http://localhost:3000/ HTTP/1.1

### 列出所有 todos
GET http://localhost:3000/todos HTTP/1.1

### 创建一条 todo
# @name createTodo
POST http://localhost:3000/todos HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "learn docker"
}

### 取出上一步返回的 _id
@todoId = {{createTodo.response.body.$._id}}

### GET 单条 todo
GET http://localhost:3000/todos/{{todoId}} HTTP/1.1

### PUT 更新单条 todo（改文本 + 标记完成）
PUT http://localhost:3000/todos/{{todoId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "learn docker compose",
  "done": true
}

### 删除单条 todo
DELETE http://localhost:3000/todos/{{todoId}} HTTP/1.1
